                                                "sense_id": "c9baab32-cce0-3d34-9e54-4534907ce1fd",
                                                "text": "You see this creature with her kerbstone English: the English that will keep her in the gutter to the end of her days. Well, sir, in three months I could pass that girl off as a duchess at an ambassador’s garden party."
                                            },
                                            {
